# Internal helper -- NOT meant to be run standalone via IC.
# PCALLed by VVDN_35L35R_COORDINATED_OPS.scn's ATDIST trigger the instant
# VDN602 (arrival) reaches the real G6 taxiway runway-exit point
# (16.057080,108.196439). Turns LNAV/VNAV off (packaged as lines inside
# this file, not chained with ";" on the outer ATDIST line -- see
# _INTERNAL_ARR_TAXI_TO_HOLD_VDN601.scn's header for why) then taxis to
# the user-specified runway-crossing hold point 16.0572,108.1974 (this
# sits almost exactly on the real G6 taxiway centerline between its
# runway-exit and apron-side ends -- see main file header) and stops
# there indefinitely -- no auto-resume timer.

00:00:00.00>VDN602 LNAV OFF
00:00:00.00>VDN602 VNAV OFF
00:00:00.00>MOVE VDN602,16.057080,108.196439,0,083,12.0
00:00:33.55>MOVE VDN602,16.057200,108.197400,0,083,0.0
